{"event": "token", "client_s": 11.925, "data": {"request_id": "127a29dfad86", "seq": 35, "ts": "2026-10-28T03:18:35.079Z", "t_ms": 11923, "delta": "* **Soft Control (Adaptive Thresholding):** Instead of relying solely on the argmax token prediction, a threshold can be"}}
